 "stimulus_html": "For the following exercises, Convert the given volume to the units shown.",
 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 526714,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "42,500 mm<sup>3</sup> = __________ cm<sup>3</sup>",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "42.5"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p><span data-math=\"42,500{\\cancel{{{\\text{millimeters}}}}^3}{\\left( {\\frac{{1{\\text{ }}\\cancel{{{\\text{meter}}}}}}{{{\\text{1,000 }}\\cancel{{{\\text{millimeter}}}}}}} \\right)^3}{\\left( {\\frac{{{\\text{100 centimeters}}}}{{{\\text{1 }}\\cancel{{{\\text{meter}}}}}}} \\right)^3}\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\" = \\frac{{42,500 \\times \\cancel{{{\\text{1,000,000}}}}}}{{1,000,\\cancel{{{\\text{000,000}}}}}}{\\text{ c}}{{\\text{m}}^3}\\,{\\text{ = }}\\,42.5{\\text{ c}}{{\\text{m}}^3}\"></span></p>\n"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 526715,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "1.5 dm<sup>3</sup> = __________ mL",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "1,500"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p><span data-math=\"1.5\\cancel{{{\\text{cubic decimeters}}}}\\left( {\\frac{{{\\text{ 1,000 milliliters}}}}{{{\\text{ 1}}\\cancel{{{\\text{cubic decimeter}}}}}}} \\right) = 1,500{\\text{ milliliters}}\"></span></p>\n<p>Note: You often have more than one conversion from which to choose. You might have chosen to convert one cubic decimeter conversion to one liter, and then convert liters to milliliters.</p>\n"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 526716,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "6.75 cm<sup>3</sup> = __________ mm<sup>3</sup>",
